<nav class="md:hidden -mx-4 px-4 mb-6 overflow-x-auto scrollbar-none" aria-label="Organisation settings sections">
<ul class="flex gap-1.5 w-max">
<li><a href="/orgs/testorg/settings" class="block whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-1.5 text-sm rounded-md border border-gray-200 text-gray-600 hover:text-gray-900 hover:bg-gray-50">General</a></li><li><a href="/orgs/testorg/settings/members" class="block whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-1.5 text-sm rounded-md border border-gray-200 text-gray-600 hover:text-gray-900 hover:bg-gray-50">Members</a></li><li><a href="/orgs/testorg/settings/integrations" class="block whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-1.5 text-sm rounded-md border border-gray-200 text-gray-600 hover:text-gray-900 hover:bg-gray-50">Integrations</a></li><li><a href="/orgs/testorg/settings/access" class="block whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-1.5 text-sm rounded-md border border-gray-200 text-gray-600 hover:text-gray-900 hover:bg-gray-50">Access</a></li><li><a href="/orgs/testorg/settings/visibility" aria-current="page" class="block whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-1.5 text-sm rounded-md border bg-gray-100 border-gray-300 text-gray-900 font-medium">Visibility</a></li><li><a href="/orgs/testorg/settings/rules" class="block whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-1.5 text-sm rounded-md border border-gray-200 text-gray-600 hover:text-gray-900 hover:bg-gray-50">Rules</a></li><li><a href="/orgs/testorg/settings/developers" class="block whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-1.5 text-sm rounded-md border border-gray-200 text-gray-600 hover:text-gray-900 hover:bg-gray-50">Developer settings</a></li>
</ul>
</nav>
<div class="flex gap-8">
<nav class="w-48 shrink-0 hidden md:block" aria-label="Organisation settings sections">
<ul class="space-y-0.5">
<li><a href="/orgs/testorg/settings" class="block px-3 py-1.5 text-sm rounded-md text-gray-600 hover:text-gray-900 hover:bg-gray-50">General</a></li><li><a href="/orgs/testorg/settings/members" class="block px-3 py-1.5 text-sm rounded-md text-gray-600 hover:text-gray-900 hover:bg-gray-50">Members</a></li><li><a href="/orgs/testorg/settings/integrations" class="block px-3 py-1.5 text-sm rounded-md text-gray-600 hover:text-gray-900 hover:bg-gray-50">Integrations</a></li><li><a href="/orgs/testorg/settings/access" class="block px-3 py-1.5 text-sm rounded-md text-gray-600 hover:text-gray-900 hover:bg-gray-50">Access</a></li><li><a href="/orgs/testorg/settings/visibility" aria-current="page" class="block px-3 py-1.5 text-sm rounded-md bg-gray-100 text-gray-900 font-medium">Visibility</a></li><li><a href="/orgs/testorg/settings/rules" class="block px-3 py-1.5 text-sm rounded-md text-gray-600 hover:text-gray-900 hover:bg-gray-50">Rules</a></li><li><a href="/orgs/testorg/settings/developers" class="block px-3 py-1.5 text-sm rounded-md text-gray-600 hover:text-gray-900 hover:bg-gray-50">Developer settings</a></li>
</ul>
</nav>
<div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
<div class="space-y-6 max-w-2xl">
<div>
<h2 class="text-lg font-bold mb-1">Visibility</h2>
<p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Who outside testorg can read the components it publishes.</p>
</div>

<div class="p-4 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg space-y-3">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
<span class="text-sm text-gray-500">Organisation</span>
<span class="inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-medium bg-gray-100 text-gray-700">Private</span>
</div>
<p class="text-sm text-gray-700">Only members can read testorg's components, except components that are made public one by one in their project settings.</p>
</div>
<p class="text-sm text-gray-600">
<strong>Public is read-only.</strong> A public component is listed on the public registry
  pages, with its readme, versions and manifest, for anyone to see, <em>including people who are
  not signed in</em>. Anyone signed in to Forest can also resolve and download it. Publishing,
  unpublishing and every other change still need membership of the organisation. The
  organisation's releases, destinations, members and settings are not shared.
</p>
<form method="POST" action="/orgs/testorg/settings/visibility" class="space-y-3">
<input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="test-csrf">
<fieldset class="space-y-2">
<legend class="sr-only">Visibility of testorg</legend>
<label class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm">
<input type="radio" name="visibility" value="private" checked class="mt-0.5">
<span><span class="font-medium">Private</span> — only members of the organisation can read it.</span>
</label>
<label class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm">
<input type="radio" name="visibility" value="public" class="mt-0.5">
<span><span class="font-medium">Public</span> — anyone can see it, even without signing in, and anyone signed in can use it. Read-only.</span>
</label>
</fieldset>
<button type="submit" class="px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-md hover:bg-gray-800">Save visibility</button>
</form>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</main>
